        <mxCell id="l0p" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this set&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Level 0&lt;/b&gt; (this page) — one process, four external entities, eight net flows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Level 1&lt;/b&gt; — that single process decomposed into 1.0–8.0, with data stores D1–D6.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Level 2&lt;/b&gt; — three of those processes decomposed further: 2.0 Master Data, 7.0 Reports, 8.0 AI Assistant.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Balancing rule: every flow crossing the boundary here reappears on Level 1, and every flow into a Level-1 process reappears on its Level-2 page." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="940" width="900" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
