        <mxCell id="l1s" value="Eight processes, four external entities, six data stores. D6 (stock transaction ledger) is required by §3.5: every change to QuantityAvailable must write a matching ledger row in the same transaction — which is why 4.0 and 5.0 both write to D2 and D6 together." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
