        <mxCell id="l1p" value="&lt;b&gt;Changes against the previous version of this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;D6 Stock Transaction Ledger added&lt;/b&gt; — §3.5 makes the ledger the source of truth; QuantityAvailable is a cached balance.&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;5.0 → D2 and 5.0 → D6 added&lt;/b&gt; — approval decrements stock and writes an Issue row. The old version updated only the request status.&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;4.0 → D2 and 4.0 → D6 added&lt;/b&gt; — approved cancellation restores stock as an Adjustment row (never by editing the Issue row).&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;D5 → 6.0 added&lt;/b&gt; — the notification feed and unread count have to read the store, not only write to it.&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;Manager → 8.0 added&lt;/b&gt; — the AI process previously produced output with no triggering input.&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;2.0 flows labelled&lt;/b&gt; — the three writes out of Manage Master Data were unlabelled arrows." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="900" height="175" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
