        <mxCell id="l2ap" value="&lt;b&gt;Note.&lt;/b&gt; Master data is deactivated, never hard-deleted (IsActive on Users, StationeryItems, Suppliers) — historical requests must keep resolving. 2.2 must refuse to deactivate a supplier that still has active items (409); 2.3 must reject a hierarchy cycle by walking the superior chain to a depth limit." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="880" width="1000" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
