        <mxCell id="l2cp" value="&lt;b&gt;Note.&lt;/b&gt; The LLM never writes to a data store — it returns text, and 8.5 is the only process here that writes anything. D7 is the evidence trail for the AI-Usage-Report deliverable: every call is logged with model, latency and whether the fallback fired. Rate limit 20 calls per user per hour; the API key is an environment variable, never part of any flow shown here." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#B0B0B0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="830" width="880" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
